bulwark-description =
    Bulwark Mail is the FreeSynergy webmail frontend, designed to work seamlessly with Stalwart as the backend.

    It connects via JMAP for fast, reliable mail access and uses Kanidm OIDC for single sign-on.
    No separate login is needed — users authenticated in FreeSynergy are automatically signed in.
    Lightweight, responsive, and built for self-hosted deployments.

bulwark-features =
    - JMAP-based mail access (fast, modern protocol)
    - OIDC single sign-on via Kanidm — no separate password
    - Compose, reply, forward with rich text and attachments
    - Full-text search across mailboxes
    - Folder and label management
    - Contact directory from Kanidm
    - Mobile-responsive interface
    - Requires Stalwart Mail as backend
